# Cross-origin isolation for the whole site: SharedArrayBuffer — which the
# debugger's pause protocol (Atomics.wait in the engine worker) requires — is
# only available on crossOriginIsolated pages. Every asset here is same-origin,
# so require-corp costs nothing; outbound fetch/XHR from playground programs
# still works (CORS applies as it always did).
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
